  "content": "\n\n<center>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/45756837e21c45354a7131427b8d4d4cb428b28c_0.webp\">\n</center>\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/ASpjFDwX\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/384923d44f1049b05e3177bd0a6065876f2cab30.png\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://x.com/MegaNecra\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/35eb2f8fb4a3356c7a5ee6b9a93cf2b83a55a765.png\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://vgen.co/MegaNecra\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aae4e3ef14436970a34f10a0e4780c3f8bfbc5f0.png\">\n  </a>\n</center>\n\n<hr>\n\n\n<center>\n這個資源包相當簡單。它透過加入自訂模型，讓官方於 1.21.5 新增的灌木與甜莓叢看起來更<b>茂密</b>一些。\n</center>\n\n<hr>\n\n<center>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/04c7d8f6ed835b3c1ca7a812feb40fa6fafdae26.png\">\n</center>\n\n<hr>\n\n<center>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4a852ac60575b82b18157009ecc7f714d15ab94e.png\">\n</center>\n  \n<hr>\n\n- 新增相連紋理（Connected Texture）支援，讓放置相鄰的灌木能自然連接。（目前正致力於讓它按我的預期運作。）\n\n<hr>\n\n<center>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9d9618da9f24df34a0e38c0f3d71dda4d49e49df.png\">\n</center>\n  \n<hr>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/nny6zZ5jLfY\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n### 特別感謝 [demonjoeTV](https://modrinth.com/user/demonjoeTV) 將此資源包納入他的 YouTube Shorts 以及上方影片中！\n[點擊這裡觀看短片！](https://www.youtube.com/shorts/_NjpefHIuR0)\n\n<center>\n<b>歡迎查看我的其他資源包！</b>\n</center>\n  \n<hr>\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/torchier-torches-mn\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6a8597445482bde9f862e56f1be258e07c98a5b4.png\">\n  </a>\n</center>\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/pointier_spears\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8d301d62c6c5a651ccae9c7359a77f4af3c7a2b6.png\">\n  </a>\n</center>\n\n<hr>\n\n## 外部連結\n\n### 正在尋找 Minecraft 皮膚或自訂 Minecraft 模型嗎？ \n**[點擊這裡](https://vgen.co/MegaNecra) 前往我的 VGen 並委託我！** \n\n### 對於如何改進此資源包有任何想法，或是想加入我的社群嗎？\n**歡迎加入我的 [Discord](https://discord.gg/ASpjFDwX)！**",
